            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Custom Colors:</strong> Choose unique frame and upholstery colors to perfectly match your facility's design.</li><li><strong>Branding &amp; Logo:</strong> Option to add company logo plates or custom branding elements.</li><li><strong>Lead Times:</strong> Vary depending on selected options, typically longer than standard delivery.</li><li><strong>Quote Required:</strong> A custom quote is needed to calculate exact pricing.</li></ul><div class=\"pdp-new__cta-row\"><a class=\"pdp-new__btn\" href=\"/pages/customization\">Request a Custom Quote</a><a class=\"pdp-new__btn pdp-new__btn--outline\" href=\"/pages/customization\">View Customization Options</a><a class=\"pdp-new__cta-link\" href=\"/pages/customization\">Need customization?</a></div>"
